stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading: Open Leads
    Loading --> Ready: Receive current snapshot
    Loading --> Empty: Receive no leads
    Loading --> Refused: Read fails
    Refused --> Loading: Refresh
    Ready --> Ready: Select owner or change page locally
    Ready --> Loading: Refresh
    Empty --> Loading: Refresh
    Loading --> Loading: Ignore superseded response
    Ready --> Idle: Session retires or page suspends
    Loading --> Idle: Session retires or page suspends
    Refused --> Idle: Session retires
    Idle --> Disposed: Dispose page
    Loading --> Disposed: Dispose page
    Ready --> Disposed: Dispose page
    Disposed --> Disposed: Ignore late completion
    %% never render vendor proposals
    %% never make an RPC for owner or page selection
    %% never revive retired data from a late completion
